%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as agent-plane
  participant P1 as PostgreSQL
  participant P2 as vmagent
  participant P3 as Command
  Note over P0,P3: agent-plane stops, collection pauses at cursor 3
  P3->>P2: output 4..9
  P3->>P2: exit 0
  Note over P2: retention drops 4..5
  Note over P0,P3: agent-plane restarts
  P0->>P1: read active actions
  P1->>P0: X1 running, cursor 3
  P0->>P2: inspect X1
  P2->>P0: X1 finished: exit 0
  P0->>P2: poll after cursor 3
  P2->>P0: gap 4..5, output 6..9
  Note over P0: save output, record gap
  P0->>P1: cursor = 9, X1 succeeded
